      Data: 74|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Ah, another soul stumbles into my domain. How\u2026 interesting. You
        thought your fate was sealed, didn't you? Yet, here you stand, alive\u2014though
        not for long, if you cannot prove your worth."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 13
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 1
      Data: game_dialog_anubis_1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 7
      Data: 75|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: I am Anubis, guardian of the dead, overseer of tombs, and judge of souls.
        You have entered the tomb not by chance, but by design. Here, your intellect
        will be tested, for only the sharpest may escape the grasp of death.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 13
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 1
      Data: game_dialog_anubis_2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 7
      Data: 76|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: It was I who granted you this second chance, mortal. You perished, and
        yet, you were not yet meant to rest. I have given you new life, but only
        so long as you can navigate the trials ahead. The ceiling above you descends
        ever closer, a reminder that time is not on your side.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 13
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 1
      Data: game_dialog_anubis_3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 7
      Data: 77|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: Remember, I offer no mercy out of kindness. I offer you the chance to
        show that you are worthy of the life I have returned to you. Now, begin your
        trials.
    - Name: 
