    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: Welcome Adventurer! Before you proceed further, please declare your intent
        to challenge the Sphinx before the Gods. Is this your first time playing?
    - Name: 
      Entry: 13
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
