    - Name: $v
      Entry: 7
      Data: 86|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: "This tomb is guarded by a corrupted exiled Sphinx, and you will face
        numerous challenges and trials\u2014complete them or risk succumbing like
        those who came before you.[Break][Break]Depending on your faith, communing
        with the Gods may prove easier when opportunities arise: their strength increases
        as you draw closer to sacred statues.[Break][Break]However, all are welcome
        under their gaze! Beware: it\u2019s advisable to visit these statues frequently:
        otherwise, you'll find yourself overwhelmed by both Sphinx's power and its
        trials."
    - Name: 
