    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Commoner","desc":"Starter classes with no unique bonuses or
        weaknesses.","active":"Most afraid of your life than anyone else, your adrenaline
        rush makes your run untiring for a few moments.","background":"An humble
        passerby that got curious and greedy about all the possible wonders and gold
        inside.","devoutness":"Neutral","unlock":""}'
