      Entry: 7
      Data: 116|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Historian","desc":"Room based class with easier rooms but you
        are slower and receive less rewards.","active":"Activate a speed buff when
        walking on sand but slows when moving outside. This is temporary and can
        be re-used.","background":"After exploring and studying countless ruins in
        the desert, you learnt how people often worship human-made creations and
        do senseless rituals. Perhaps there''s something real, you ask yourself everyday.
        With your knowledge and expertise on how to walk faster in the desert, you
        set forward to the Tomb of the Sunless Dawn to learn the truth about the
        Gods.","devoutness":"Sceptic ","unlock":"Avoid all sand patches for 2 levels"}'
    - Name: 
