      Entry: 7
      Data: 117|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Messenger","desc":"Movement based class with more obstacles
        and worse slow effects","active":"Resist magic pillars effects and prevent
        passive ramp down","background":"Years of delivering written parchment between
        royals made you naturally atheletic and strong willed, forgoing any attachment
        to the gods. Thus, you are able to move faster and faster until something
        breaks your momentum. One day, gossips about a stolen important parchment
        hidden inside the Tomb of the Sunless Dawn set your next goal in life: get
        it back.","devoutness":"Atheist","unlock":"Only buy speed related items for
        5 levels."}'
    - Name: 
