      Data: 118|System.String[], mscorlib
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Exiled","desc":"Chaotic based class. Shop offers no blessings
        but you are able to increase the odds or frequency of receiving stronger
        blessings.","active":"","background":"Once a restless zealot of the gods,
        you read all the available books but none satisfied your cravings for more.
        The more you learnt, the more maniac you became. Eventually, unorthodox practices
        led to your exile preventing access to blessings. However, prior ancient
        knowledge enables you to attempt deceive the Gods into casting lesser blessings
        and strenghten your body.","devoutness":"Complicated","unlock":"Reach level
        20"}'
