    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Innitiate","desc":"Challenge based class. Start as an inferior
        sample of an human being. Are you able to reach to the top?","active":"","background":"Recently
        joined the order, you are seen as inferior by the Gods. To prove your worth,
        you must overcome harduous challenges. Thus, you set forward to the Tomb
        of the Sunless Dawn. However, Gods have spoken that every trial completed
        and pain suffered leaves a lasting scar on your body and soul.","devoutness":"Believer","unlock":"Unlock
        all other classes"}'
