    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Envoy","desc":"Anti trap based class. Knowledge of the tomb
        decreases traps spawned and their effects.","active":"","background":"You
        received notice the Tomb of the Sunless Dawn will soon be visited by skilled
        adventurers. Sent by the high council, your task is to recover and protect
        hidden treasures of the tomb located at the very end. To help in this endeavor,
        you signed a pact with the gods to increase the value of all remains of the
        past you find. However, failing to fulfil your part will erase all prior
        collections.","devoutness":"Zealot","unlock":"Pick all currency in each room
        for 2 levels in a row. Only counts from level 5+"}'
