      Data: 1
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: '{"name":"Acolyte","desc":"Blessing based class. Highest devotion to
        the Gods allows weaving of blessings, but traps are worse and you move slower","active":"","background":"Dreams
        of transcendance at the end of the Tomb of the Sunless Dawn inspire you to
        take leap of faith and venture forth into the tomb.Having done and learnt
        everything about the gods, the only piece missing is joining them in the
        afterlife. Your devotion to the gods bestow upon you mystical powers which
        enables to extend or reapply blessings more often.","devoutness":"Fanatic","unlock":"Always
        buy and use an item per level. Minimum reach level 15"}'
